;/a&gt;。周二，它们的股价首次跌破 83 美元的首次公开募股价格，抹去了涌入该人工智能实验室创纪录首次亮相的投资者的收益。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;该股周二下跌 6.5%，收于 81.91 美元，较 IPO 价格低 1% 以上。在 Anthropic 首次公开募股之前，对这项有争议的技术的支出速度的担忧已经扰乱了股市。华尔街观察家本月早些时候表示，历史上最大规模的公开发行的走向&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/gq0_jygF58UUi9kI2u35EONwXW1CIPQ5UXdOXCLt5D9jrLM3M2crQvBzoF36lVE342ZmQigDM9HJX1I7H3BqB-Hp2E9bpm2AexY5jVqpZ7I0R2FzISqkmTBBW6wh0h8EiyQB7_xqsk_nHaHnXYjaPuNJn_414-ZGc92Ea5R66Mlc56W6rDP0ngVgEgBR2SWyn9aqEQxLE_rhFyCU0CpY8tvR7f_u4cyPORdq9RUUR_THgDs0vOISCLdIqw2QdFDbgqgKoqLpneemeiKJysj5CfXLVtZKbMjlDTiTSbyIN2aUICOlrx0RxpG2pQThsBPvbpSiAARZzN2uJwJeChlB-5hULszi_kh-dJzPse3gcRtyd6JD18G1wtxhww1L4uwMnBzubHaYM0lfkgPKbEw5TBaJvjJ9U59dYqov0E5VG3AkZLPoJU_IuvrzLDAqYp2g99Lv-4zYU1qtDqMIU0ytxe7utFHI3ovwKEDfgc-qe4Okl69og3u_PiLw9aUqVwfTM9J89hkRJEZy53e8hqgQDSr2UGJM5pp0_A/h9SSHNS44O3767t9Ayf1HndiRZZiO9DS/26" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="Anthropic 的 IPO 被视为人工智能的真正清算"&gt;将是对人工智能行业未来的重大考验&lt;/a&gt;。现在还处于赛季初期，但投球看起来很弱。 &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top: 24px;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/UBKtqmazHzLk8bZLCmP7FB7PARSA1WF_jQ-CVOPV9ny5AQ1D7r5wd3TxPF6k_J6J4nEwgCaxIL-ZPEvh7HKbyoDp3scA7ejaX3KKmHivCf4CNkW8_kmMrqbArhoL3pokuBH4LIc0HKgauXroHcYqRmUMKmPhOBP9fOXH-fW9_7LkqQE_q8h4bXj08UiRkG6bZT6NsSheAw6j0bKchJBqMFWR1Hx9tUa7S0v3fArGjNwJvCmMHH_eHvMUJBrEzamjQAd0_l-831wDknLfLIMFfd-rWp92kkm7LoURvKQPDTLOiaerIDydR_iUBSzch2_1q0QL81SccWMyqjs5VKDq_fkMaBuexE0pUgu3cDSsMVhWZxB1b8lySvVwawQrbsHF_hDCEZ4NnWyfaocWfk5WeAWBTggLpK1dKFSx_eZnqmw97waNkKMg8pSCsF7ReRXAHsEnJy7pVOtdHRMfpd6gGdj0lphvOYuJ9YyLEks8tCrgAkEWbHlBumDNuYa_m5R-YoXQ4OfP3kNR_jREKDob7RCyVOur/p92_Uyah0hSWUqbCzY_vBn0ITgoA2Uq1/26" style="font-size: inherit; color: inherit; text-decoration: none;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;div style="border-top: 1px solid; margin: 0 0 24px 0;"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style="line-height: normal; margin: 12px 0 0 0; color: inherit; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px !imp