display: block;" /&gt;&lt;!--[if mso]&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;![endif]--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 style="line-height: normal; font-weight: 700; margin: 12px 0 0 0; font-size: 20px !important;"&gt; COP31 的崩溃是对行动的号召&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style="line-height: 1.4; margin: 12px 0 0 0; color: inherit; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px !important;"&gt;这是关于应对气候变化的斗争为何失败以及如何应对的三篇社论中的第二篇。 &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style="display: block; width: 100%; height: 40px; text-align: center; line-height: 40px; border: 1px solid; border-radius: 8px; margin: 16px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px !important;"&gt;阅读更多&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 30px; font-weight: 700; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid; margin-top: 40px;"&gt;特别零集&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div style="margin: 20px 0; background-color: #f5f5f5; border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/UWHT0I8uDM6GYYCxsjfXOR_KCZRR7zrkQ9-ZbTbnRimgMItO4OSKjzR3gdCdqF-MKzT5fx35viCOOVtdfTGBM_tFl_ShdBqPYxkY77YBALRdh129Ceej_NbOVTqspAo0S583juXhOJLcsdWdy3UngQZI5wlo9S-GdrZDOz2KLCBChJEsZ03FkMEFS3TmjSXkPm6_t9YInkm2wF8YawdaqSgl6qxnGPjuE7Szqy1K9iS2qp6_6s3SHBpQphTQ04SUuW-caqG-bnv32KsH9EAarIQuCBAqvLbN3qLzpZZFKWYSx7kQYubI6Nmr9NELtl-VwEizRfkMm6bwfY7geL5iUG-DLzZpCf73jlQ6PEYY5tb5XNoc21wioHlNEemmyYUt86DCEnY7QMlty2to2mzIuuJLufJbA28vCjYua9p2CnqbfLbRRzLCMhECTiek6veirm_g7dMmCUznSfajNQJu9Z903yNdmuXcIqjVnCkf8o8ys_gEK5icpRAD2PfJ4T8ZF5C2aR13Mf5MoN2lVATYwcVcnaSK631VxcikI0jY7f8eegiCiA/bYLYCsPT0lCgHHrJDbJQFOzOovM2E8yc/26" style="font-size: inherit; text-decoration: none; color: inherit;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;" width="100%"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden;" valign="top" width="80"&gt;&lt;img alt="零" height="80" src="https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/i3XUkKZjZvV4/v10/-1x-1.png" style="display: block; border-radius: 10px;" width="80" /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td width="12"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="top"&gt;&lt;p style="font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.4; margin: 0; color: inherit; font-size: 16px !important;"&gt;零&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="line-height: 1.2; margin: 4px 0 0 0; color: inherit; font-size: 16px !important;"&gt;COP31气候峰会崩溃的内幕&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td width="12"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="bottom" width="28"&gt;&lt;img alt="立即收听" height="28" src="https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/ihClwsFiKu8o/v0/-1x-1.png" style="display: block; border-radius: 10px;" width="28" /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;上周末，在土耳其安塔利亚举行的 COP31 气候峰会上的谈判以惊人的方式破裂，世界无法达成任何共识协议来加速能源转型的进展。那么到底出了什么问题，有什么成果吗？本周&lt;em style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;《零》&lt;/em&gt;节目中，阿克沙特·拉蒂 (Akshat Rathi) 与 Bloomberg Green 记者约翰·安格 (John Ainger) 和詹妮弗·A·德卢希 (Jennifer A Dlouhy) 进行了交谈。过去两周他们一直在安塔利亚，见证了 COP31 混乱的最后时刻。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt; &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/RLADgWCX7BaoMTQN-CmVUABtuj0L2ODwWVziwnIszm1o1qPUJgE1SUoC7zetxR7L1rYUd7lJGIo0TNrZairiq2UwXCGW7ZLLIaH7OlIm9Fb-lf5sldFuW2bdCd9PPnjVxxL9rSVXzl0ApQcv1VxhIIV2pE960k7EGGTnbpR6DFBFFt3xSsMwt5BB52E4ibVBKY_0HFmUD20BI988a5SoemUVV3euisQ8sh-H-LdIgUxcKdPqFdaEgoqvsxODxiuux7hcMNZzJGOklmV-qU57wBSpCOEm2HfeDJbtEG8ti8ymfeKjpHg2b-3wdufGQOEDK3pHWBePFNRyMUCVWOtmOQrY6YREwSk/1Ha5kNnGIMe1HVQ7nTj6Yc78IhL9MH9Q/26" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="COP31气候峰会崩溃的内幕——零"&gt;立即收听&lt;/a&gt;，并在&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/JYinECuVlNTZY6Bbljj5U597m6RVx-rBrwjUJP5ViaehkWsb19MJoa-LVAsHN23XS91BpesrGZL9bfPjSkO74W-EyQ1AuoaokeMBDrFUyXUiDG_cch9RYGqcvbvjdnZdu1uXH-3Z8r3meZT00qYA0n5hf8OPYoJgq7USH-IBvzuwU5xDfp8jSlRi9ho8OpRjZ4WFnjmm1_bMaYz16Bkmi8rtCA9dfC5xksTfQjTRtLQ8crYvGVTqWLBiC1pZQ49mG48epgvzPNeVzFvdktCjL_6WnFrsJ1dF_Uxk94dZcnDbXCJbL0a-DUf9UVeOXQWxtX8COw/2DG7_Ovs7OEPQUDqWlWr8Nl64qV7CYT_/26" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="